1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,171
Then a twist.

2
00:00:01,171 --> 00:00:10,260
Ethers dissolve in water about as well as the alcohols do: six and a half grams per hundred, against seven point nine for butanol.

3
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,015
Why?

4
00:00:11,015 --> 00:00:14,062
Because water brings its own hydrogens.

5
00:00:14,062 --> 00:00:21,210
The ether oxygen's lone pairs accept hydrogen bonds from water, even though the ether can never donate one.

